{
  "description": "Prose, then two calls: the first two separated by \"; \" (the separator serving stacks split on), a third on its own line with \"parameters\" before \"name\"; the separators are content.",
  "markup": "Let me check both.\n{\"name\": \"get_weather\", \"parameters\": {\"city\": \"Oslo\"}}; {\"name\": \"read_file\", \"parameters\": {\"path\": \"notes.txt\", \"limit\": 10}}\n{\"parameters\": {\"city\": \"Bergen\", \"unit\": \"celsius\"}, \"name\": \"get_weather\"}",
  "tools": [
    {
